    <!-- M2a permission walkthrough. COUPLING CONTRACT (M2-PLAN §2.2, CI-checked):
         this file and service:enforcement's admin_description string cover the
         same three facts — 1) the system shows "Parental controls active", 2)
         uninstalling FamilyGuard is blocked while the admin is on, 3) the child CAN
         turn it off in Settings > Apps > Special access > Device admin apps, which
         notifies the parent. Nothing is hidden. -->
